SUMMARY:Moving to Heylo
DESCRIPTION:Go Wild Hikers Have Moved to Heylo.com\nHello Hikers\,\nIf you
 've enjoyed hiking with this group\, follow me as I move Go Wild Hikers to
  a new platform by the end of May. This is not the end but the beginning o
 f a different trail for Go Wild Hikers. It's people like you that have mad
 e this group so great!! Thank you all for being members of Go Wild Hikers 
 and I appreciate the large number of Hikers who have already followed the 
 group to Heylo. The Shiloh Hike on Sunday May 31 is nearly full.\n**I will
  continue to post new hikes on Heylo every Friday.**\n**Upcoming events fo
 r Go Wild Hikers in June will include Hood Mtn\, Taylor Mtn\, Annadel and 
 North Sonoma Mtn to Jack London.**\n[https://heylo.com/invite/PpURbZWX](ht
